    "text": "State of Sea: The sea areas off the coasts extending from Kankasanthurai to Kalpitiya via Mannar and from Hambantota to Pottuvil will be rough at times. The sea areas off the coasts extending from Kalpitiya to Hambantota via Colombo, Galle and Matara will be fairly rough at times. The other sea areas around the island will be moderate.",
